<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Bone Skin</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 24)
Mana: 50
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast bone skin</a>   (on yourself only)
</pre>
<p>The caster utters 'Episa hues' and their skin hardens like bone, as good as 
chain mail. Wherever a blow lands on a part of you that wears no armour, 
your skin counts as chain. Where you do wear armour, the armour counts as 
before.
</p><p>It lasts a few minutes, longer the better your spell, and then wears off. It 
is especially useful when you go to fetch your corpse with nothing on (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Die</a>). It doesn't add up with leather skin, bark skin or stone skin: 
only one natural armour spell works at a time. You must be standing. It is 
also found on potions and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Leather Skin</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Bark Skin</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Stone Skin</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>